WEBVTT

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:30.630
in order to give
a patient a peaceful death?

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:35.730
The price-tag difference
was eye-popping for sure,

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:38.930
but it wasn't our decision to make,
this was our mom's call.

00:15:39.897 --> 00:15:41.997
She said,

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:43.963
"That's crazy. Are you kidding me?

00:15:43.997 --> 00:15:46.630
I'll take the 400-dollar one,
I'm leaving anyway."

00:15:46.663 --> 00:15:49.830
(Laughter)

00:15:51.997 --> 00:15:53.863
The night before her death,

00:15:53.863 --> 00:15:57.030
we had a dinner party
at her house at her request.

00:15:58.363 --> 00:15:59.863
We made a beautiful feast

00:15:59.897 --> 00:16:02.363
of roast chicken, colorful salad,